  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would be great if VRChat Mobile supported the phone’s gyroscope so we could look around by physically moving the phone—like in VR. This would also let us use those mobile VR headsets where you put the phone in (like Cardboard-style ones), which could give a more immersive experience even without a full VR setup.\n\nAlso, please add proper support for Bluetooth controllers. Touch controls are super limited on mobile, and using a gamepad would make movement and interactions way smoother and more comfortable.\n\nThese features would make VRChat Mobile way more accessible, fun, and closer to the full VR experience for users who don’t have a headset.",
